'''Selena''' (ナミエちゃん, ''Namie-chan'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Sunny Celeboodle]] introduced in [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]]. She was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Selena
|image = E 416.png
|first appearance = [[Leak Year]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 13|Infernal Tower - Floor 13]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
Compared to [[Sunny Celeboodle]], Selena has much higher health and deals more damage per hit, with no delay between attacks, but has one additional knockback and significantly shorter range. She also a 100% chance of knocking back cats and a 40% chance of slowing them.

==Strategy==
For the most part, the same strategy that works against Sunny Celeboodle also works against Selena: meatshield non-stop while slowly whittling down her health with long-ranged attackers, including [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and other heavy hitters. Avoid using short-ranged units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titans]] against Selena, as they will most likely be killed or knocked back repeatedly before they have a chance to attack. Also, if you time [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] correctly, you can easily stunlock her.

